        "starterCode": "-- Step 1 Starter (conditional-aggregation-filter): Base accounts relation scan\nSELECT\n  account_id,\n  owner_name,\n  account_type,\n  posted_balance_cents,\n  version\nFROM accounts\nORDER BY account_id ASC;",
        "solutionCode": "-- Step 1 Solution (conditional-aggregation-filter): Account balances in USD with optimistic version metadata\nSELECT\n  account_id,\n  owner_name,\n  account_type,\n  currency,\n  posted_balance_cents,\n  ROUND(posted_balance_cents / 100.0, 2) AS posted_balance_usd,\n  version AS optimistic_lock_version\nFROM accounts\nORDER BY posted_balance_cents DESC, account_id ASC;"
