        "hint": "-- Step 1 Solution (snowflake-vs-star-vs-obt): NULL-safe telemetry event latency filter\nSELECT\n  event_id,\n  user_id,\n  event_type,\n  latency_ms,\n  event_ts\nFROM user_events\nWHERE latency_ms IS NOT NULL\nORDER BY latency_ms DESC, event_id ASC;",
