        "title": "Step 1: Inspect Issued Cards & Daily Spend Limits (cohort-retention-matrix-sql)",
        "concept": "Examine the `cards` table in `fintech_ledger` to inspect active vs frozen cards and daily limit thresholds.",
        "instructions": "Refine the starter `cards` query in `query.sql` to convert `daily_limit_cents` into `daily_limit_usd` and join account owners.",
        "hint": "-- Step 1 Solution (cohort-retention-matrix-sql): Issued cards enriched with account owner & USD limit\nSELECT\n  c.card_id,\n  a.owner_name,\n  c.last4,\n  ROUND(c.daily_limit_cents / 100.0, 2) AS daily_limit_usd,\n  c.status AS card_status\nFROM cards AS c\nINNER JOIN accounts AS a\n  ON a.account_id = c.account_id\nORDER BY c.daily_limit_cents DESC, c.card_id ASC;",
        "file": "query.sql",
        "targetFile": "query.sql",
        "starterCode": "-- Step 1 Starter (cohort-retention-matrix-sql): Raw cards table inspection\nSELECT\n  card_id,\n  account_id,\n  last4,\n  daily_limit_cents,\n  status\nFROM cards\nORDER BY card_id ASC;",
        "solutionCode": "-- Step 1 Solution (cohort-retention-matrix-sql): Issued cards enriched with account owner & USD limit\nSELECT\n  c.card_id,\n  a.owner_name,\n  c.last4,\n  ROUND(c.daily_limit_cents / 100.0, 2) AS daily_limit_usd,\n  c.status AS card_status\nFROM cards AS c\nINNER JOIN accounts AS a\n  ON a.account_id = c.account_id\nORDER BY c.daily_limit_cents DESC, c.card_id ASC;"
