        "phase": "Phase 2 · Materialized Views, Refresh Strategies & Incremental View Maintenance (IVM): Merchant Transaction Spend vs Card Limit",
        "title": "Step 2: Aggregate Merchant Spend per Card (Materialized Views, Refresh Strategies & Incremental View Maintenance (IVM))",
        "concept": "Join `cards` with `merchant_txns` to compare cumulative card spend against `daily_limit_cents`.",
        "instructions": "Complete the grouped card spend query in `query.sql` to compute `txn_count` and `total_spend_usd`.",
        "hint": "-- Step 2 Solution (materialized-views-incremental-refresh): Aggregated card spend vs daily limit utilization\nSELECT\n  c.card_id,\n  c.last4,\n  c.status AS card_status,\n  COUNT(mt.txn_id) AS txn_count,\n  ROUND(SUM(mt.amount_cents) / 100.0, 2) AS total_spend_usd,\n  ROUND(c.daily_limit_cents / 100.0, 2) AS daily_limit_usd\nFROM cards AS c\nINNER JOIN merchant_txns AS mt\n  ON mt.card_id = c.card_id\nGROUP BY c.card_id, c.last4, c.status, c.daily_limit_cents\nORDER BY total_spend_usd DESC;",
        "file": "query.sql",
        "targetFile": "query.sql",
        "starterCode": "-- Step 2 Starter (materialized-views-incremental-refresh): Join cards and merchant_txns\nSELECT\n  c.card_id,\n  c.last4,\n  mt.merchant,\n  mt.amount_cents,\n  mt.txn_ts\nFROM cards AS c\nINNER JOIN merchant_txns AS mt\n  ON mt.card_id = c.card_id\nORDER BY mt.txn_ts ASC;",
        "solutionCode": "-- Step 2 Solution (materialized-views-incremental-refresh): Aggregated card spend vs daily limit utilization\nSELECT\n  c.card_id,\n  c.last4,\n  c.status AS card_status,\n  COUNT(mt.txn_id) AS txn_count,\n  ROUND(SUM(mt.amount_cents) / 100.0, 2) AS total_spend_usd,\n  ROUND(c.daily_limit_cents / 100.0, 2) AS daily_limit_usd\nFROM cards AS c\nINNER JOIN merchant_txns AS mt\n  ON mt.card_id = c.card_id\nGROUP BY c.card_id, c.last4, c.status, c.daily_limit_cents\nORDER BY total_spend_usd DESC;"
