        "starterCode": "-- Step 1 Starter (build-saas-cohort-funnel-workbench): Raw user_events stream inspection\nSELECT\n  event_id,\n  user_id,\n  event_type,\n  latency_ms,\n  event_ts\nFROM user_events\nORDER BY event_id ASC;",
