        "hint": "-- Step 1 Solution (index-bloat-write-amplification-traps): Normalized review sentiment & NULL-safe comment\nSELECT\n  review_id,\n  product_id,\n  customer_id,\n  rating,\n  CASE\n    WHEN rating >= 4 THEN 'POSITIVE'\n    WHEN rating = 3 THEN 'NEUTRAL'\n    ELSE 'CRITICAL'\n  END AS sentiment_band,\n  COALESCE(comment, 'No written comment') AS review_text,\n  created_at\nFROM product_reviews\nORDER BY rating DESC, review_id ASC;",
