        "instructions": "Execute the sliding-window card velocity query in `query.sql` and inspect the window frame results.",
        "hint": "-- Dataset: fintech_ledger | The RUM Conjecture: B+Tree vs LSM-Tree Read, Write & Space Amplification (btree-vs-lsm-read-write-space-amplification) — Sliding 3-Txn Card Velocity Window\nSELECT\n  txn_id,\n  card_id,\n  merchant,\n  country,\n  ROUND(amount_cents / 100.0, 2) AS amount_usd,\n  txn_ts,\n  COUNT(*) OVER (\n    PARTITION BY card_id\n    ORDER BY txn_ts ASC\n    ROWS BETWEEN 2 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW\n  ) AS window_txn_count,\n  ROUND(\n    SUM(amount_cents) OVER (\n      PARTITION BY card_id\n      ORDER BY txn_ts ASC\n      ROWS BETWEEN 2 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW\n    ) / 100.0,\n    2\n  ) AS rolling_3txn_usd\nFROM merchant_txns\nORDER BY card_id ASC, txn_ts ASC;",
        "file": "query.sql",
        "targetFile": "query.sql",
        "starterCode": "-- Step 3 Starter (btree-vs-lsm-read-write-space-amplification): Ordered merchant transactions per card\nSELECT\n  txn_id,\n  card_id,\n  merchant,\n  country,\n  ROUND(amount_cents / 100.0, 2) AS amount_usd,\n  txn_ts\nFROM merchant_txns\nORDER BY card_id ASC, txn_ts ASC;",
        "solutionCode": "-- Dataset: fintech_ledger | The RUM Conjecture: B+Tree vs LSM-Tree Read, Write & Space Amplification (btree-vs-lsm-read-write-space-amplification) — Sliding 3-Txn Card Velocity Window\nSELECT\n  txn_id,\n  card_id,\n  merchant,\n  country,\n  ROUND(amount_cents / 100.0, 2) AS amount_usd,\n  txn_ts,\n  COUNT(*) OVER (\n    PARTITION BY card_id\n    ORDER BY txn_ts ASC\n    ROWS BETWEEN 2 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW\n  ) AS window_txn_count,\n  ROUND(\n    SUM(amount_cents) OVER (\n      PARTITION BY card_id\n      ORDER BY txn_ts ASC\n      ROWS BETWEEN 2 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW\n    ) / 100.0,\n    2\n  ) AS rolling_3txn_usd\nFROM merchant_txns\nORDER BY card_id ASC, txn_ts ASC;"
