        "solutionCode": "-- Step 1 Solution (realtime-olap-clickhouse-mergetree): Issued cards enriched with account owner & USD limit\nSELECT\n  c.card_id,\n  a.owner_name,\n  c.last4,\n  ROUND(c.daily_limit_cents / 100.0, 2) AS daily_limit_usd,\n  c.status AS card_status\nFROM cards AS c\nINNER JOIN accounts AS a\n  ON a.account_id = c.account_id\nORDER BY c.daily_limit_cents DESC, c.card_id ASC;"
